# core-posting
ok 1 - an unbalanced journal is refused -- REQ: FIN-006, COM-006
ok 2 - a missing mandatory dimension is refused -- REQ: FIN-013, FIN-005
ok 3 - a closed period refuses the posting -- REQ: FIN-010, D-15
ok 4 - an unmapped business event is blocked -- REQ: FIN-014, XMD-005
ok 5 - a balanced journal posts and is numbered JNS00000068 -- REQ: FIN-006, FIN-011
ok 6 - negative stock is refused -- REQ: ITM-013, D-09
ok 7 - a receipt increases the stock balance -- REQ: ITM-013, ITM-014
ok 8 - a lot reference is required on every movement -- REQ: ITM-010, D-09
